[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0009","text":"饲养员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0010","text":"今天是奖励日哦～\n要给这头大象喂它最爱的西瓜"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0020","text":"好厉害……！用脚踩碎了\n连小孩子都能那么轻松地踩碎啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0029","text":"导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0030","text":"那么斑鸠小姐，能请你给大象喂一下西瓜吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0040","text":"诶…………\n我来啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0049","text":"饲养员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0050","text":"那就请把这个递给它────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0060","text":"────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0070","text":"啊哈，路加酱的西瓜被吃掉了──\n好可爱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0089","text":"导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0090","text":"啊哈哈，它很开心呢\n斑鸠小姐，能再喂一个吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0100","text":"…………那就────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0105","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_03_0106","text":"Motion"}]
